        <rdfs:label>FunctionCall</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Invocation of a function in a pipeline. Can reference a defined Function by name, OR inline a callable directly for external library functions, OR inline an equation, OR use class_call for class instantiation. Mirrors Function attributes so pipeline steps can be self-contained. The `name` is an optional step label (used in pipelines for keyed access to step outputs); it is NOT a global identifier (singleton uses like `loss`, `observable` may omit it).</skos:definition>
        <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/FunctionCall"/>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo"/>
    </owl:Class>
    


