        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Intrinsic structural trait of a Dynamics model (e.g. sigmoid activation, fast-slow decomposition, E/I subpopulations). Distinct from BackendCapability: a feature is what the model has, a capability is what a backend provides.</rdfs:comment>
