        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Continuation"/>
        <dcterms:description>Continue the equilibrium branch of the Generic2dOscillator as parameter a is varied. Detect Hopf bifurcations and continue periodic orbits from all Hopf points.</dcterms:description>
