        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Network"/>
        <dcterms:description>Schaefer2018 100-parcel 7Networks multi-graph network from Hansen et al. (2022). Contains structural connectivity (SC) from diffusion MRI tractography and functional connectivity (FC) from resting-state fMRI, both derived from the HCP Young Adult cohort. SC edge weights are log-transformed streamline counts normalized to [0, 1]. FC edge weights are Pearson correlations.</dcterms:description>
